title FUNC01 – Phan ra chuc nang: Xac thuc & Quan ly Tai khoan

* He thong Quan ly Thuc tap <<root>>
** 1. Xac thuc & Quan ly Tai khoan <<module>>
*** 1.1. Dang nhap he thong <<group>>
**** Nhap ten dang nhap & mat khau <<func>>
**** Xac thuc thong tin (JWT) <<func>>
**** Phan quyen theo vai tro <<func>>
**** Tra ve token & thong tin nguoi dung <<func>>
*** 1.2. Dang xuat <<group>>
**** Xoa session / token phia client <<func>>
*** 1.3. Doi mat khau <<group>>
**** Nhap mat khau cu <<func>>
**** Xac thuc mat khau cu <<func>>
**** Nhap & xac nhan mat khau moi <<func>>
**** Cap nhat mat khau vao CSDL <<func>>
*** 1.4. Quen mat khau (OTP) <<group>>
**** Nhap Email dang ky <<func>>
**** Gui ma OTP qua Email <<func>>
**** Kiem tra han su dung ma OTP <<func>>
**** Xac minh ma OTP hop le <<func>>
**** Nhap mat khau moi <<func>>
**** Dat lai & luu mat khau <<func>>
*** 1.5. Xem / Cap nhat ho so ca nhan <<group>>
**** Xem thong tin tai khoan <<func>>
**** Sua ho ten, email, SDT, dia chi <<func>>
**** Luu thay doi <<func>>
*** 1.6. Quan tri Tai khoan (Admin) <<group>>
**** Tao tai khoan moi (Admin) <<func>>
**** Chon vai tro (SV / GV / DN / Admin) <<func>>
**** Kich hoat tai khoan <<func>>
